description	"Salacious B. Crumb

^8Attributes:
- Strength (1)
- Rally

^3Abilities:
- Jump (2)
- Fury (1) ^3[CS1 Melee]

Salacious B. Crumb was a Kowakian monkey-lizard who lived as a jester in the court of the crime lord Jabba Desilijic Tiure during the Galactic Civil War. Known for his shrill laughter, Crumb kept his master amused."